<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine says set $5.73 bln reverse repos Aug 15.</title>
<headline>Argentine says set $5.73 bln reverse repos Aug 15.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $5.73 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements August 15.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were placed at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668))</p>
